Third-party content
===================

The bundled Garry's Mod API dataset
(packages/glua-lsp/src/api/data/gmod-api.json) is generated from the Garry's Mod
wiki at https://wiki.facepunch.com/gmod. That documentation content — function
descriptions, parameter names, type information and examples — belongs to
Facepunch Studios and the wiki's contributors, not to this project.

It is redistributed here so the extension works offline. The scraper that
produces it is at packages/glua-lsp/tools/generate-api.mjs.

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers this project's own source code.
